 Eliason","role":"Ung Fredrik"},{"id":6429770,"name":"Henny Hassel","role":"Ung tjej i zombiehus"},{"id":6429771,"name":"Estrid Engvall","role":"Ung Petra"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Halloween Park","overview":"Un gruppo di amici vince un'esclusiva anteprima di Hallowen nel parco divertimenti di Liseberg. Ma quella che inizia come una serata di festa con zucchero filato, popcorn e montagne russe, si trasforma rapidamente in un incubo quando si rendono conto di non essere soli nel parco."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Carousel","overview":"Park manager Fiona is tasked with taking care of some former friends who won an exclusive private sneak preview of Halloween at Liseberg – a whole night, all alone in the empty park. But cotton candy, lovely rides and lots of laughter soon turn into something completely different, as they realize they are not alone in the park. And the night of dreams quickly turns into a true nightmare.","tagline":"An exclusive private Halloween night at Liseberg quickly turns into a true nightmare."},{"language":"sv-SV","overview":"Parkvärden Fiona blir utvald till att ta hand om några före detta vänner som har vunnit en exklusiv, privat smygpremiär av halloween på Liseberg - en hel natt, helt ensamma. Men sockervadd, härliga åk och skratt övergår snart i något helt annat, då de inser att de inte är ensamma i parken. Och drömnatten förvandlas snabbt till en riktig mardröm."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kaa6Mwomh31ImBMpgCC1n8wqbb5.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kaa6Mwomh31ImBMpgCC1n8wqbb5.png","language":"en","width":4319,"height":848},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/itzgriI26AgsI6qOBvr9aWizaOU.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/itzgriI26AgsI6qOBvr9aWizaOU.png","language":"en","width":1183,"height":190},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origin